#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:1 86dce6f6633042d8b949bab8eca65870
msgid "数据管理（Data Management）"
msgstr "Data Management"

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:3 97afea26ca8146a8abb86350822f31d2
msgid ""
"`Data Management` 用来记录项目、模型版本、数据路径和备注。它不负责生成结构，也不负责训练； 它解决的是另一个问题：当你有很多轮 "
"DFT、很多个 `nep.txt`、很多个候选池和训练结果时， 还能知道每个文件属于哪一次实验。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Data Management` to record projects, model versions, data paths, and "
"notes. It neither generates structures nor trains models. Its purpose is to "
"preserve provenance when several DFT rounds, `nep.txt` files, candidate "
"pools, and training results accumulate."

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:7 c6a659d87fd5478ea91f79db489e205d
msgid "什么时候值得用"
msgstr "When to use it"

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:9 103b379204cf43b3b5b7cfff3531aaec
msgid "下面这些情况建议开始记录："
msgstr "Start recording versions when any of the following applies:"

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:11 8ab6ca66ef17411a8e216c97b56bdc6e
msgid "同一个材料体系已经做了多轮主动学习。"
msgstr "The same material system has gone through several active-learning iterations."

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:12 1125511b993e4a528415effe33f69f06
msgid "每一轮都有候选结构、清洗结构、DFT 结果、训练模型和测试结果。"
msgstr ""
"Each iteration has its own candidate structures, cleaned structures, DFT "
"results, trained model, and test results."

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:13 fa0e571e43f54f098daa4e20d6e6c18b
msgid "你需要对比不同 `nep.txt` 的误差、备注和适用范围。"
msgstr ""
"You need to compare the errors, notes, and applicability of different "
"`nep.txt` files."

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:14 0450d733a716403c887edf6aacb9767c
msgid "你经常回头找“上次那个效果好的模型在哪个目录”。"
msgstr ""
"You often have to rediscover which directory contains a previously "
"successful model."

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:16 58a0aed9ff0c450dbd9bbfb62575e2e7
msgid "如果只是临时试一张卡片，不一定需要马上建项目。"
msgstr "A quick one-off card experiment does not necessarily need a project record."

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:18 5e43ad94f3a442e88732ab2a0a82dec6
msgid "推荐记录方式"
msgstr "Recommended record structure"

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:20 9dba1108cb7c4073bc50e2268b4ab56c
msgid "可以按材料体系或研究主题建立 `Project`，再把每一轮模型作为 `Model(version)` 记录进去。"
msgstr ""
"Create a `Project` for a material system or research topic, then record each"
" model iteration as a `Model(version)`."

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:22 0a620d54fa5241979089a526cb797802
msgid "一个常见结构是："
msgstr "A typical record looks like this:"

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:24 d6d407bff76143278aa391bcb10d3630
msgid ""
"Project: TiH2 surface defects\n"
"  v001: 初始 bulk + surface 数据\n"
"  v002: 加入 vacancy / adsorbate 候选结构\n"
"  v003: 清洗后 FPS 采样并完成 DFT\n"
"  v004: 回看训练误差后补高力结构\n"
msgstr ""
"Project: TiH2 surface defects\n"
"  v001: initial bulk and surface data\n"
"  v002: add vacancy and adsorbate candidates\n"
"  v003: clean, sample with FPS, and complete DFT labels\n"
"  v004: inspect training errors and add high-force structures\n"

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:32 d3ad3ccca67040d89877408b48f57025
msgid "每个版本建议至少记录："
msgstr "Record at least the following for each version:"

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:34 f90986c7a26b42429b2b2c3b1b4b6175
msgid "模型或结果目录路径。"
msgstr "The model or results directory."

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:35 b37df5cd093b46d99528e87016e14e6a
msgid "对应的训练集来源。"
msgstr "The source of the associated training set."

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:36 1b1524aa243f4763b772e7aa63555a16
msgid "简短备注：这一轮补了什么结构、删了什么异常、模型适合什么范围。"
msgstr ""
"A short note describing which structures were added, which anomalies were "
"removed, and where the model is intended to be used."

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:37 08556454b8934eed862b9aadf37f7456
msgid "标签：例如 `surface`、`defect`、`magnetic`、`failed`、`baseline`。"
msgstr "Tags such as `surface`, `defect`, `magnetic`, `failed`, or `baseline`."

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:39 0da85fafcbee464d8e8c717ce182cb21
msgid "和主流程的关系"
msgstr "Place in the main workflow"

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:41 ea47193b359b46b9875afe4ac82c119c
msgid "`Data Management` 更适合放在每轮流程结束后使用："
msgstr "Use `Data Management` at the end of a meaningful iteration:"

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:43 969684eafbc34ccf9f57c64651f4aaf5
msgid ""
"Make Dataset 生成候选结构\n"
"-> NEP Dataset Display 清洗\n"
"-> DFT\n"
"-> GPUMD 训练\n"
"-> NEP Dataset Display 回看\n"
"-> Data Management 记录这一轮\n"
msgstr ""
"Make Dataset generates candidates\n"
"-> NEP Dataset Display cleans the pool\n"
"-> DFT provides labels\n"
"-> GPUMD trains the model\n"
"-> NEP Dataset Display reviews the result\n"
"-> Data Management records the iteration\n"

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:52 eb4d6e2907fc4b2baa211a68ded3f6e3
msgid "这样记录的是已经有明确意义的版本，而不是每个临时文件。"
msgstr ""
"This keeps records at meaningful version boundaries instead of creating an "
"entry for every temporary file."

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:54 25fa3f06542544beaee16b73506a33cc
msgid "常用操作"
msgstr "Common operations"

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:56 4035a85138b24d9f8f743976f4bf3f49
msgid "新建、修改、删除 `Project`。"
msgstr "Create, edit, or delete a `Project`."

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:57 9a433420f7ee41ba8c8d2d90332183a4
msgid "新建、修改、删除 `Model(version)`。"
msgstr "Create, edit, or delete a `Model(version)`."

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:58 1c341896265a42e7bd5d52d0cee99605
msgid "打开本地目录或 URL。"
msgstr "Open a local directory or URL."

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:59 3bfe414dcae543b3921593a984604bb0
msgid "用 `Ctrl+F` 搜索项目、标签、备注或路径。"
msgstr "Press `Ctrl+F` to search projects, tags, notes, or paths."

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:61 b2071031317041349eb62de4927d5342
msgid "存储位置"
msgstr "Storage location"

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:63 9b9518b2fc2b4d25b778c1bf9b1b373b
msgid "本地数据库默认放在用户配置目录："
msgstr "The local database is stored in the user configuration directory by default:"

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:65 eac47f9d3f194cd7ba7538d8e1d5209c
msgid "Windows：`C:\\Users\\<You>\\AppData\\Local\\NepTrainKit\\mlpman.db`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:66 834773945777479d9982753d95185c0e
msgid "Linux：`~/.config/NepTrainKit/mlpman.db`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/data-management.md:68 7dbae516e17044f98a6162f03f62c2e1
msgid "这个数据库只记录管理信息，不会自动复制你的大体积训练数据。移动训练目录后，记得更新记录里的路径。"
msgstr ""
"The database stores management metadata only; it does not copy large "
"training datasets. If a training directory moves, update its path in the "
"corresponding record."
